word for the one person upon whom the interest centres, but aggressively stylish for an advocate; *college* stylish for *school* but the working word for—*college*.
>>>

<<<
Others again, such as bodeful & deem & dwell & maybe, lose their unhappy stylish air when they are in surroundings of their own kind, where they are not conspicuous like an escaped canary among the sparrows.
===
Others again, such as *bodeful* & *deem* & *dwell* & *maybe*, lose their unhappy stylish air when they are in surroundings of their own kind, where they are not conspicuous like an escaped canary among the sparrows.
>>>

